IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Assessments/assessment_operations/private/
IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Assessments/IUEA_ML_Gradebook_Semester1.xlsx
IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Assessments/Grading_Update_By_Hand_2026-11-03.md
**/_backup_2026-11-02/
**/_backup_2026-11-03/
**/_backup_2026-11-04/

# Private test deployment backups and rehearsal evidence
IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Assessments/test_operations/private/

# Keep explicit answer keys and hidden assessment data out of the public repository.
IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Weeks_08-12/Project/grader_spec/
IUEA_Teaching_Plan/Weeks_08-12/Project/Lecturer_Marking_Guide.*
**/Facilitator Materials/
